WEBVTT

00:00:17.690 --> 00:00:20.300
<b>Truth is... I'm a pedophile.</b>

00:00:21.570 --> 00:00:26.840
<b>I go to the local elementary schools every day and stare at the girls in gym class.</b>

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:31.590
<b>And as I watch those chaste, curveless chests, I can hardly contain my Sandalphon.</b>

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:34.600
<b>Grade schoolers are the best!</b>

00:00:35.590 --> 00:00:36.720
<b>Okay.</b>

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:39.240
<b>Not bad.</b>

00:00:39.240 --> 00:00:40.320
<b>What?!</b>

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:44.700
<b>There's more to me than that, though.</b>

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:47.900
<b>My severe Oedipus Complex drives me to kiss my mother's photo goodbye every morning,</b>

00:00:47.900 --> 00:00:52.190
