<b>I'd like to walk around the city with you tomorrow.</b>

00:04:02.340 --> 00:04:03.160
<b>Huh?</b>

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:04.340
<b>That's... uh...</b>

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:05.840
<b>A date.</b>

00:04:06.850 --> 00:04:08.970
<b>Sorry, I've got plans.</b>

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:10.700
<b>A boyfriend wouldn't say no.</b>

00:04:10.700 --> 00:04:12.310
<b>He sure wouldn't.</b>

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:13.840
<b>10 o'clock in the morning.</b>

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:16.740
<b>I will be by the sculpture in West Tengu Park.</b>

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:20.180
<b>Shido!</b>

00:04:20.180 --> 00:04:23.000
<b>How do I make a phone call?!</b>

00:04:23.970 --> 00:04:24.820
<b>Sorry!</b>

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:27.820
<b>Hello? Onii-chan?</b>

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:30.020
<b>Origami asked me out on a date.</b>

00:04:30.020 --> 00:04:30.830
<b>Huh?</b>

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:33.620
<b>Kotori?</b>

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:36.720
<b>You should've just ignored her.</b>

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:39.720
<b>It's <i>our</i> fault that she thinks I'm her boyfriend.</b>

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:43.500
<b>I can't just keep toying with her emotions!</b>

00:04:45.520 --> 00:04:47.200
<b>All right, then...</b>

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:50.140
<b>why don't you give her a reason to hate you?</b>

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:02.280
<b>How do you like the outfit I got for your date?</b>

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:04.030
<b>Perfect. It's sickening.</b>

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:07.360
<b>It's almost 11 o'clock.</b>

00:05:07.360 --> 00:05:08.480
<b>Got it.</b>

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:11.120
<b>AI settings have been modified.</b>

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:14.840
<b>We're going to make this the worst date in history.</b>

00:05:14.840 --> 00:05:16.460
<b>Always remember that we've got your back.</b>

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:18.080
<b>I'm counting on you.</b>

00:05:18.080 --> 00:05:20.980
<b>You made sure that Tohka's occupied, right?</b>

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:23.520
<b>Yeah, she's out grocery shopping.</b>

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:25.720
<b>Could I have a kilo of pork, pretty please?</b>

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:28.500
<b>We'll keep an eye on Tohka,</b>

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:30.760
<b>so don't worry about bumping into her.</b>

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:32.380
<b>It's time for "first contact."</b>

00:05:40.450 --> 00:05:41.780
<b>H-Hey!</b>

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:46.520
<b>Thank goodness.</b>

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:49.530
<b>I thought something had happened to you.</b>

00:05:50.150 --> 00:05:51.620
<b>Get it together!</b>

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:54.320
<b>Guilt will <i>not</i> be tolerated on this mission!</b>

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:55.540
<b>Right...</b>

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:57.290
<b>Clothes...</b>

00:05:58.430 --> 00:06:00.540
<b>Oh, uh...</b>

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:02.360
<b>What do you think of my clothes?</b>

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:06.200
<b>O-Oh, <i>your</i> clothes! I think it looks nice—</b>

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:06.560
<b>Wow, did you see that guy's shirt?!</b>

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:08.000
<b>No, tell her it looks <i>horrendous</i>!</b>

00:06:08.000 --> 00:06:10.500
<b>It looks like shit!</b>

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:13.720
<b>What would you rather I wear?</b>

