00:11:43.180 --> 00:11:45.080
<b>Shido, where are you?</b>

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:45.900
<b>Origami!</b>

00:11:45.900 --> 00:11:47.560
<b>Just sit tight. I'll be back!</b>

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:55.440
<b>Tohka!</b>

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:58.440
<b>Sh-Shido...</b>

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:00.120
<b>I was lying.</b>

00:12:03.150 --> 00:12:04.000
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:05.740
<b>R-Really?</b>

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:06.450
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:09.450
<b>You don't hate me?</b>

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:11.960
<b>Of course not! How could I ever hate you?</b>

00:12:11.960 --> 00:12:15.460
<b>So I can still be with you?</b>

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:16.460
<b>Of course.</b>

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:18.460
<b>We can be together forever?</b>

00:12:19.830 --> 00:12:20.960
<b>Together forever.</b>

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:23.880
<b>Okay.</b>

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:26.220
<b>Okay.</b>

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:29.760
<b>Look!</b>

00:12:29.760 --> 00:12:31.460
<b>I got everything you asked for!</b>

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:33.360
<b>Oh, you did great.</b>

00:12:37.990 --> 00:12:39.730
<b>O-Origami?!</b>

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:40.940
<b>Together...</b>

00:12:40.940 --> 00:12:41.730
<b>forever.</b>

00:12:41.730 --> 00:12:43.400
<b>Wh-What?</b>

00:12:43.400 --> 00:12:44.740
<b>Let go of him!</b>

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:46.800
<b>He said that to <i>me</i>!</b>

