00:13:10.420 --> 00:13:11.560
<b>Congratulations, Shido.</b>

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:42.300
<b>Gallop, gallop.</b>

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:44.160
<b>Tobiichi Origami!</b>

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:45.300
<b>You little—</b>

00:13:48.190 --> 00:13:49.640
<b>Hi-yah!</b>

00:13:54.110 --> 00:13:55.620
<b>I feel a little better now.</b>

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:56.400
<b>Just a little?!</b>

00:13:56.400 --> 00:13:57.560
<b>After what you just did?!</b>

00:13:57.970 --> 00:13:59.920
<b>Aren't we gonna be in trouble?</b>

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:03.320
<b>If you've got time to complain, spend it on Tohka.</b>

00:14:03.830 --> 00:14:06.100
<b>Your date's only just begun.</b>

00:14:07.930 --> 00:14:09.320
<b>Today, as on others...</b>

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:12.060
<b>our date goes on.</b>

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:18.330
<b>What are you doing, Tobiichi Origami?!</b>

00:14:18.330 --> 00:14:21.060
<b>I am merely "being with" Shido.</b>

00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:22.340
<b>You're not funny!</b>

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:24.590
<b>Stop getting between us.</b>

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:26.590
<b><i>You're</i> getting between <i>us</i>!</b>

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:29.220
<b>I think you'll find it is you who is in the way.</b>

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:30.560
<b>What was that?!</b>

00:14:30.560 --> 00:14:32.120
<b>If you've got something to say, just say it!</b>

00:14:32.120 --> 00:14:33.150
<b>You're a nuisance.</b>

00:14:35.070 --> 00:14:35.850
<b>Hey there.</b>

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:37.160
<b>Hey.</b>

00:14:38.170 --> 00:14:39.420
<b>Oh, that's—</b>

00:14:39.420 --> 00:14:41.700
<b>Oh, you noticed?</b>

00:14:42.850 --> 00:14:44.300
<b>Cute, isn't it?</b>

00:14:44.300 --> 00:14:46.600
<b>This is Fur Selle, the rainbow fur seal.</b>

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:48.360
<b>I fished him out at an arcade yesterday.</b>

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.750
<b>Part of the "awkwardly cute" trend, I suppose?</b>

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:49.960
<b>What did you say?!</b>

00:14:49.960 --> 00:14:51.180
<b>You filthy liar!</b>

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:52.560
<b>I guess I'll never understand how that caught on.</b>

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:54.040
<b>I'll make you regret everything you've ever said!</b>

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:55.660
<b>I am merely stating the facts.</b>

00:14:55.660 --> 00:14:56.200
<b>Wha—</b>

00:14:56.990 --> 00:14:59.370
<b>High school girls love them.</b>

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:01.880
<b>There's a whole set of them.</b>

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:03.540
<b>Oh, I'd like to get that one.</b>

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:04.400
<b>Ah.</b>

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:06.840
<b>Pandalone, the dream panda.</b>

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:10.980
<b>Sorry, gimme a sec.</b>

00:15:10.980 --> 00:15:12.020
<b>No need to apologize!</b>

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:13.890
<b>Converse to your heart's content!</b>

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:16.890
<b>I shall converse with <i>my</i> girlfriend as well.</b>

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:18.220
<b>What's up, Kotori?</b>

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:20.140
<b>The hell are you doing, hagfish?!</b>

00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:23.420
<b>Tohka's mood meter just dropped like a rock!</b>

00:15:23.420 --> 00:15:23.900
<b>What?</b>

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:25.460
<b>Don't gimme that.</b>

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:27.400
<b>Don't you remember what happened the other day?</b>

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:31.040
<b>When her mood becomes unstable,</b>

00:15:31.040 --> 00:15:35.030
<b>her Spirit powers can return to her.</b>

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:35.030
<b>Unhappy</b>

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:35.030
<b>Unhappy</b>

00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:38.400
<b>She should probably let off some steam.</b>

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:41.500
<b>Let off some steam, huh?</b>

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:42.500
<b>How?</b>

00:15:42.500 --> 00:15:43.540
<b>Let's see...</b>

00:15:44.010 --> 00:15:45.840
<b>A quick and easy way would be...</b>

00:15:50.050 --> 00:15:52.800
<b>Tobiichi Origami, you little poopyhead!</b>

00:15:59.410 --> 00:16:00.810
<b>Okay, next!</b>

00:16:03.310 --> 00:16:06.310
<b>Tobiichi Origami, you dumb bonehead!</b>

00:16:10.480 --> 00:16:11.900
<b>You're so ugly!</b>

00:16:18.740 --> 00:16:20.120
<b>And flat-chested!</b>

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:24.250
<b>Sicko!</b>

00:16:29.840 --> 00:16:31.840
<b>Freak!</b>

00:16:35.840 --> 00:16:37.600
<b>That'll get us in big trouble!</b>

00:16:38.190 --> 00:16:41.500
<b>Arcades are so much fun!</b>

00:16:40.030 --> 00:16:41.500
<b>All right. Let's clean this up!</b>

00:16:41.500 --> 00:16:42.600
<b>Clock's ticking!</b>

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:45.350
<b>Bring the new one here once you're done.</b>

00:16:45.350 --> 00:16:48.190
<b>They're from Ratatoskr?</b>

00:16:48.190 --> 00:16:51.440
<b>Obviously, we already talked to the owner.</b>

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:52.640
<b>This is odd.</b>

00:16:52.640 --> 00:16:53.440
<b>What's wrong?</b>

00:16:54.430 --> 00:16:57.360
<b>Tohka's mood level is steadily increasing,</b>

00:16:57.360 --> 00:16:59.700
<b>but the anxiety score is unusually high.</b>

00:17:00.150 --> 00:17:02.880
<b>She must be worried about something.</b>

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:04.060
<b>She is?</b>

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:05.420
<b>Oh, well.</b>

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:07.710
<b>Let's let her play and see how things go.</b>

00:17:11.900 --> 00:17:13.460
<b>What's this one?</b>

00:17:13.890 --> 00:17:15.100
<b>Oh, perfect.</b>

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:17.240
<b>Go ahead and snap a few cutesy pictures with her.</b>

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:21.970
<b>Basically, this lets you take nice photos.</b>

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:24.480
<b>Ph-Photos?!</b>

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:25.400
<b>What's wrong?</b>

00:17:25.400 --> 00:17:29.020
<b>I-I just don't like "photos" very much.</b>

00:17:29.020 --> 00:17:29.960
<b>Oh?</b>

00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:31.720
<b>Okay, we can go check out something else.</b>

00:17:32.330 --> 00:17:33.380
<b>Hold on!</b>

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:35.510
<b>Shido...</b>

00:17:35.510 --> 00:17:37.490
<b>Do you want a photo of me?</b>

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:40.740
<b>Well, yeah.</b>

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:44.750
<b>Just this once...</b>

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:47.440
<b>Just this once, I'll make an exception.</b>

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:51.760
<b>Hey, aren't we—</b>

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:53.180
<b>Stay out, you idiot!</b>

00:17:53.180 --> 00:17:55.260
<b>Wait a minute, you dumb doodoo head!</b>

00:17:56.510 --> 00:17:57.760
<b>What's up with her?</b>

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:00.360
<b>I never knew she was so shutter shy.</b>

00:18:00.360 --> 00:18:04.060
<b>I remember taking a photo of her for her health exam.</b>

00:18:04.060 --> 00:18:05.770
<b>Oh, that explains it.</b>

00:18:10.750 --> 00:18:11.520
<b>What?</b>

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:12.420
<b>Huh?</b>

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:15.240
<b>Don't look at it here.</b>

00:18:15.240 --> 00:18:16.530
<b>O-Okay.</b>

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:22.280
Pandalone

00:18:24.310 --> 00:18:28.680
<b>I heard that there's some couple going around wrecking the machines.</b>

00:18:28.680 --> 00:18:30.860
<b>And it's the <i>girl</i> who's wrecking them!</b>

00:18:30.860 --> 00:18:32.290
<b>Gross.</b>

00:18:43.300 --> 00:18:44.580
<b>I'm out of coins.</b>

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:46.480
<b>I'll get you in a minute.</b>

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:51.560
<b>Remember, <i>only</i> look at it when you're all alone.</b>

00:18:51.560 --> 00:18:52.880
<b>All right.</b>

00:18:53.310 --> 00:18:55.440
Pandalone

00:18:54.150 --> 00:18:55.640
<b>Oh, it's these things.</b>

00:18:55.440 --> 00:18:55.570
Pandalone

00:18:55.570 --> 00:18:55.690
Pandalone

00:18:55.640 --> 00:18:57.200
<b>Want me to get it for you?</b>

